---

This repository is a reimplementation of the IEGMN encoder and docking head of
EquiBind (https://github.com/HannesStark/EquiBind, Stärk et al.,
arXiv:2202.05146), which is released under the MIT licence. It is a rewrite
rather than a patched copy, and it redistributes none of the authors' code or
weights; the attribution above is given because the method is theirs.
